(5567962, 805016, 108320, '<td valign="top">very nice mood. nice composition. tilt-shift lens? I can almost hear how the noise in the mall blends out of their heads :-) the slight off-center of the family makes it a bit strange.</td>', 'very nice mood. nice composition. tilt-shift lens? I can almost hear how the noise in the mall blends out of their heads :-) the slight off-center of the family makes it a bit strange.', '2009-07-10 12:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567973, 804763, 68256, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture!  My favorite of the challenge so far.  I love the tones..great job on the b/w conversion.  My only "critique" would be the shifting of the kids to the right and cutting off the last girl''s arm, but the emotion captured on these kid''s faces makes up for it.</td>', 'Awesome capture!  My favorite of the challenge so far.  I love the tones..great job on the b/w conversion.  My only "critique" would be the shifting of the kids to the right and cutting off the last girl''s arm, but the emotion captured on these kid''s faces makes up for it.', '2009-07-10 13:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5567980, 805016, 68256, '<td valign="top">Oh man this is good....What a wonderful eye you have to see and capture this.  The lines are awesome and the "centerdness" of the subjects is wonderful.  I can''t say enough about it.  If I could give it more than 10 I would!</td>', 'Oh man this is good....What a wonderful eye you have to see and capture this.  The lines are awesome and the "centerdness" of the subjects is wonderful.  I can''t say enough about it.  If I could give it more than 10 I would!', '2009-07-10 13:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568004, 805146, 106806, '<td valign="top">sooooo..... you''ve got your arms outstretched holding out the wings, what did you press the trigger with ;-)  first picture I''ve seen that''s relevant to the competition title and a good one with it</td>', 'sooooo..... you''ve got your arms outstretched holding out the wings, what did you press the trigger with ;-)  first picture I''ve seen that''s relevant to the competition title and a good one with it', '2009-07-10 13:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568006, 805216, 106806, '<td valign="top">can''t quite see the from above in this but danged if I''m scoring it low for that - what an amazing passionate picture</td>', 'can''t quite see the from above in this but danged if I''m scoring it low for that - what an amazing passionate picture', '2009-07-10 13:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568027, 805299, 106806, '<td valign="top">omg !!! please tell me they''re lying down not buryed standing up ....</td>', 'omg !!! please tell me they''re lying down not buryed standing up ....', '2009-07-10 13:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568031, 805480, 106806, '<td valign="top">hmmm....don''t quite get the ''from above'' for this but as with another picture in this category danged if I''m letting that affect the score ... zorks I love this photo</td>', 'hmmm....don''t quite get the ''from above'' for this but as with another picture in this category danged if I''m letting that affect the score ... zorks I love this photo', '2009-07-10 13:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
