(5568125, 804657, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great timing! This is indeed a really fun shot. I really gotta try the canonball one day ;)  (no vote, just leaving comments)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great timing! This is indeed a really fun shot. I really gotta try the canonball one day ;)  (no vote, just leaving comments) ', '2009-07-10 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568129, 804608, 108564, '<td valign="top">Highlights in the foreground seem a bit too washed out for me</td>', 'Highlights in the foreground seem a bit too washed out for me', '2009-07-10 15:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568130, 805486, 108564, '<td valign="top">You need to work on focus.  I don''t see a sharp focus anywhere here.  Also, there is a bit too much noise.</td>', 'You need to work on focus.  I don''t see a sharp focus anywhere here.  Also, there is a bit too much noise.', '2009-07-10 15:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568131, 803992, 108564, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a discernable subject here.  Is it the stairs?  The people are too close to the wall to be the subject.</td>', 'I don''t see a discernable subject here.  Is it the stairs?  The people are too close to the wall to be the subject.', '2009-07-10 15:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568134, 805017, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Really fun take on the ole flower from above. Odd that someone had to initiate a validation request as this looks like something perfectly real, but on the other hand I''d take it as an honor that they thought it was too good to be true ;)<br/>I''d only suggest some light fill on the right side of the frame, or dodge the highlights there. Would really add a bit of pop I think. (no vote, just leaving comments)</td>', 'Very creative. Really fun take on the ole flower from above. Odd that someone had to initiate a validation request as this looks like something perfectly real, but on the other hand I''d take it as an honor that they thought it was too good to be true ;)I''d only suggest some light fill on the right side of the frame, or dodge the highlights there. Would really add a bit of pop I think. (no vote, just leaving comments)', '2009-07-10 16:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568137, 805443, 108564, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as a very dynmaic subject.  To me, there isn''t anything really going on here.  Perhaps if it were in color something would pop.</td>', 'I don''t see this as a very dynmaic subject.  To me, there isn''t anything really going on here.  Perhaps if it were in color something would pop.', '2009-07-10 16:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568145, 804043, 108564, '<td valign="top">I would like this if it seemd like the bridge was part of the composition...as it is way up at the top though, I feel like it is just blocking my view.</td>', 'I would like this if it seemd like the bridge was part of the composition...as it is way up at the top though, I feel like it is just blocking my view.', '2009-07-10 16:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568147, 803989, 108564, '<td valign="top">wow - that could have been realy bad.  You posted this...so I assume you are still alive : ) Was this planned?  I don''t see how it could have been.  I''m giving you a high vote because the view is great.  Hopefull I won''t find out that this was staged : ) Only problem with it is the blown out highlight on the left top of the screen....but I''m sure you knew that.</td>', 'wow - that could have been realy bad.  You posted this...so I assume you are still alive : ) Was this planned?  I don''t see how it could have been.  I''m giving you a high vote because the view is great.  Hopefull I won''t find out that this was staged : ) Only problem with it is the blown out highlight on the left top of the screen....but I''m sure you knew that.', '2009-07-10 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568148, 805456, 108564, '<td valign="top">I like the color....but I think if you are going to do a macro it should be much sharper and I would like to see more light falling on the subject.  A bit too dark for my taste.</td>', 'I like the color....but I think if you are going to do a macro it should be much sharper and I would like to see more light falling on the subject.  A bit too dark for my taste.', '2009-07-10 16:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568149, 804770, 108564, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that this is the best subject.  There is nothing particularly odd or pretty about it ....I do like the color though.</td>', 'I don''t know that this is the best subject.  There is nothing particularly odd or pretty about it ....I do like the color though.', '2009-07-10 16:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568152, 805016, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great sentiment. One of the best uses of selective/creative blur (in camera or PS) I''ve seen in a while. One of my top10 faves from the challenge. (no vote, just leaving comments).</td>', 'Great sentiment. One of the best uses of selective/creative blur (in camera or PS) I''ve seen in a while. One of my top10 faves from the challenge. (no vote, just leaving comments).', '2009-07-10 16:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568153, 803940, 108564, '<td valign="top">I like it....but I don''t get it.  She is holding a samurai sword, correct?  Is she standing in a trash heap?  If so, why?  Her sandals and bare feet distract my eyes from her face and pose.</td>', 'I like it....but I don''t get it.  She is holding a samurai sword, correct?  Is she standing in a trash heap?  If so, why?  Her sandals and bare feet distract my eyes from her face and pose.', '2009-07-10 16:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568154, 804274, 108564, '<td valign="top">are you actually above them or just slightly higher than them?  I really like the photo but I don''t think it is a good pick for the "From Above" challenge.</td>', 'are you actually above them or just slightly higher than them?  I really like the photo but I don''t think it is a good pick for the "From Above" challenge.', '2009-07-10 16:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568157, 804088, 108564, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and wonderful crispness....my only bad thing would be that I''m just sick of seeing bug macros as much as I am sick of water drops!  But - I understand that sometimes that is what you have.....and this is a really good one. 6 (lower score based on creativity).</td>', 'Beautiful colors and wonderful crispness....my only bad thing would be that I''m just sick of seeing bug macros as much as I am sick of water drops!  But - I understand that sometimes that is what you have.....and this is a really good one. 6 (lower score based on creativity).', '2009-07-10 16:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568158, 805383, 108564, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the contrast.  Get rid of the border. 6</td>', 'I like the composition and the contrast.  Get rid of the border. 6', '2009-07-10 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568159, 805359, 108564, '<td valign="top">There is another rowing shot this challenge....and sorry to say the other one is composed better.  I don''t like the cutting off of the boat and the birds to me are a distraction.  Also, like I told the other person - get rid of the border.  Nice tonality though. 5</td>', 'There is another rowing shot this challenge....and sorry to say the other one is composed better.  I don''t like the cutting off of the boat and the birds to me are a distraction.  Also, like I told the other person - get rid of the border.  Nice tonality though. 5', '2009-07-10 16:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568160, 804221, 108564, '<td valign="top">This is not from above nor is it anything more than a casual snapshot.  1 - no challenge relevance and no creativity.</td>', 'This is not from above nor is it anything more than a casual snapshot.  1 - no challenge relevance and no creativity.', '2009-07-10 16:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568162, 805411, 108564, '<td valign="top">This is not shot from above nor is it focused.  The color is nice but the soft effect does nothing for it.  I give it a 2 just because I like the color.</td>', 'This is not shot from above nor is it focused.  The color is nice but the soft effect does nothing for it.  I give it a 2 just because I like the color.', '2009-07-10 16:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568164, 804632, 108564, '<td valign="top">This is cropped too tightly.  Okay -  - he''s heading for rapids....would have been nice to see some of the surroundings in this shot.  Exposure/contrast/sharpness is all good....just not a very exciting subject.  I give it a 5 because technically it is a well exposed shot.</td>', 'This is cropped too tightly.  Okay -  - he''s heading for rapids....would have been nice to see some of the surroundings in this shot.  Exposure/contrast/sharpness is all good....just not a very exciting subject.  I give it a 5 because technically it is a well exposed shot.', '2009-07-10 16:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568165, 804283, 108564, '<td valign="top">Creative subject but the focus could be a bit sharper....also would have like it lit a bit brighter.  5.</td>', 'Creative subject but the focus could be a bit sharper....also would have like it lit a bit brighter.  5.', '2009-07-10 16:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568168, 805467, 108564, '<td valign="top">Okay - this is a really great shot of a baseball....seriously.  I love the texture, the tones, great exposure and composition.  However, for this challenge I think it just gets lost because nobody cares what a round object looks like from above (for the most part).  A ball looks the same from above as it does from the side. I give it a 5 still though - because I really do like the photo.</td>', 'Okay - this is a really great shot of a baseball....seriously.  I love the texture, the tones, great exposure and composition.  However, for this challenge I think it just gets lost because nobody cares what a round object looks like from above (for the most part).  A ball looks the same from above as it does from the side. I give it a 5 still though - because I really do like the photo.', '2009-07-10 16:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5568170, 805495, 108564, '<td valign="top">Needs more....the color could be a bit richer and the top right of the photo not so dark.  4.</td>', 'Needs more....the color could be a bit richer and the top right of the photo not so dark.  4.', '2009-07-10 16:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
