(5569073, 805320, 32011, '<td valign="top">One of my top 4 photos in this challenge.  I don''t quite understand the title, but haven''t let that effect my vote.  I love the colour in this photo... the rich orange and red is wonderful.  Great composition... a top 10 finish for you in store.</td>', 'One of my top 4 photos in this challenge.  I don''t quite understand the title, but haven''t let that effect my vote.  I love the colour in this photo... the rich orange and red is wonderful.  Great composition... a top 10 finish for you in store.', '2009-07-12 03:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5569077, 805480, 32011, '<td valign="top">The dynamic element and the unorthodox perspective in this images makes it... combined with the clarity on the items onboard and the brilliant colours, you''ve got yourself a probable top 10 photo here... I''ve got it equal first in my voting with 3 others.</td>', 'The dynamic element and the unorthodox perspective in this images makes it... combined with the clarity on the items onboard and the brilliant colours, you''ve got yourself a probable top 10 photo here... I''ve got it equal first in my voting with 3 others.', '2009-07-12 03:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5569079, 805412, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed image, and its great that you''ve managed to get the details in the floorboards in the umbrellas shadow.  I find the dirty marks on the umbrella a bit of a negative, though it does highlight the amount of detailed you''ve managed to capture in this shot.</td>', 'Nicely composed image, and its great that you''ve managed to get the details in the floorboards in the umbrellas shadow.  I find the dirty marks on the umbrella a bit of a negative, though it does highlight the amount of detailed you''ve managed to capture in this shot.', '2009-07-12 03:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5569082, 805062, 32011, '<td valign="top">On my voting pass though this challenge, I gave this a 7, but now on my commenting pass, I''m going to bump this up to an 8 (along with only 4 other images).  This is a great shot... totally different from anything else in the challenge... you have great vision, and that you managed to capture this moment speaks volumes for you skill.  The more I look at it, the harder I find it not to give it a 9... bugger it... I''ll give you a 9.  Congratulations.</td>', 'On my voting pass though this challenge, I gave this a 7, but now on my commenting pass, I''m going to bump this up to an 8 (along with only 4 other images).  This is a great shot... totally different from anything else in the challenge... you have great vision, and that you managed to capture this moment speaks volumes for you skill.  The more I look at it, the harder I find it not to give it a 9... bugger it... I''ll give you a 9.  Congratulations.', '2009-07-12 03:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5569085, 804131, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo, and a style of photo I expected to see more of in the challenge... but surprisingly, there were very few of this type and I think this will do well as a result of not being one of an over done sub theme.  The b&amp;w processing suits this shot well... it''s nice and sharp... only criticism of the composition is the amount of weight the rock at the centre bottom has in the image.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo, and a style of photo I expected to see more of in the challenge... but surprisingly, there were very few of this type and I think this will do well as a result of not being one of an over done sub theme.  The b&w processing suits this shot well... it''s nice and sharp... only criticism of the composition is the amount of weight the rock at the centre bottom has in the image.', '2009-07-12 03:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5569086, 804988, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is an image that needed a good title to get the viewer to explore the image, and you''ve done well here.  It''s a solid image, though it might have done better if it was a little sharper... feels a bit soft.</td>', 'This is an image that needed a good title to get the viewer to explore the image, and you''ve done well here.  It''s a solid image, though it might have done better if it was a little sharper... feels a bit soft.', '2009-07-12 03:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
