(5569118, 805338, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''ve bumped this up a point from what I original gave it while doing my voting.  On closer inspection when commenting led me to believe that I was a bit harsh initially... this is crystal clear sharp... could have perhaps done with a tad more colour (saturation) and the flakes of fish food are somewhat distracting, but this is a very goot photo... much better than most in this challenge.</td>', 'I''ve bumped this up a point from what I original gave it while doing my voting.  On closer inspection when commenting led me to believe that I was a bit harsh initially... this is crystal clear sharp... could have perhaps done with a tad more colour (saturation) and the flakes of fish food are somewhat distracting, but this is a very goot photo... much better than most in this challenge.', '2009-07-12 07:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5569119, 804257, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is SHARP... not a fan of the centred composition, but the sharpness and colours make up for that somewhat.</td>', 'This is SHARP... not a fan of the centred composition, but the sharpness and colours make up for that somewhat.', '2009-07-12 07:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
