(5574058, 804913, 29011, '<td valign="top">Splendid shot all around! Eh those DNMC votes. You can easily see the top back of the bird, this was shot really straight down. Don''t think I''ve ever seen a flamingo shot from this angle before. It creates a beautiful curve with its neck.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-15 00:21:27.</i></td>', 'Splendid shot all around! Eh those DNMC votes. You can easily see the top back of the bird, this was shot really straight down. Don''t think I''ve ever seen a flamingo shot from this angle before. It creates a beautiful curve with its neck.', '2009-07-15 01:20:44.000000', '2009-07-15 01:21:27.000000', 0),
(5574062, 805480, 17203, '<td valign="top">Duh- I should have recognized your work from the color alone. Very eye-catching, although I didn''t get a strong sense of "from above" in this one. The angle reduces the importance of the POV for me, and the water looks like a passing train or something. Still, I gave it a 7 for the visual story and strong technicals. Hope you enjoyed the trip!</td>', 'Duh- I should have recognized your work from the color alone. Very eye-catching, although I didn''t get a strong sense of "from above" in this one. The angle reduces the importance of the POV for me, and the water looks like a passing train or something. Still, I gave it a 7 for the visual story and strong technicals. Hope you enjoyed the trip!', '2009-07-15 01:21:29.000000', NULL, 0),
