(5574329, 804222, 67258, '<td valign="top">Firstly, congrats on producing a fantastic photo, secondly congrats on your new PB and a great challenge finish.</td>', 'Firstly, congrats on producing a fantastic photo, secondly congrats on your new PB and a great challenge finish.', '2009-07-15 03:20:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574339, 805299, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats. Not bad for a non-FS.</td>', 'Congrats. Not bad for a non-FS.', '2009-07-15 03:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574356, 805299, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats man, well deserved. Seems you''re on a roll again.</td>', 'Congrats man, well deserved. Seems you''re on a roll again.', '2009-07-15 03:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574358, 805062, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red and a fantastic shot, Hugo. Have to visit Lisboa soon if it has places like this</td>', 'Congrats on the red and a fantastic shot, Hugo. Have to visit Lisboa soon if it has places like this', '2009-07-15 03:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574363, 805299, 39825, '<td valign="top">head shot. :-) very cute. :-)))</td>', 'head shot. :-) very cute. :-)))', '2009-07-15 03:54:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574367, 805299, 28742, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling. :) Way to phone it in, Shannon. :P</td>', 'I had a feeling. :) Way to phone it in, Shannon. :P', '2009-07-15 04:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574371, 805435, 58683, '<td valign="top">I really love this image, especially the composition, all the interesting lines and angles. This was one of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'I really love this image, especially the composition, all the interesting lines and angles. This was one of my favorites for the challenge.', '2009-07-15 04:26:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574375, 805062, 28742, '<td valign="top">Yep yep yep. :D Congrats on a great image and the ribbon. Got a solid 8 from me.</td>', 'Yep yep yep. :D Congrats on a great image and the ribbon. Got a solid 8 from me.', '2009-07-15 04:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574377, 805217, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats!</td>', 'Congrats!', '2009-07-15 04:32:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574379, 805463, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> This colorful image rocks! Top 5 for sure. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Damn! Missed it by <i>this</i> much! :D Congrats anyways - it did very well and is a great image.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: This colorful image rocks! Top 5 for sure.  Damn! Missed it by this much! :D Congrats anyways - it did very well and is a great image.', '2009-07-15 04:34:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574381, 805351, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DJWoodward:</b></div><hr/><i> Challenge Relevance:7  </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL - "Shot From Above" - what would it take to get a 10?? ;-) Nice job. Nice finish.</td>', 'Originally posted by DJWoodward: Challenge Relevance:7   LOL - "Shot From Above" - what would it take to get a 10?? ;-) Nice job. Nice finish.', '2009-07-15 04:36:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574383, 804763, 28742, '<td valign="top">Solid 9 from me, Doc - congrats on 11th.</td>', 'Solid 9 from me, Doc - congrats on 11th.', '2009-07-15 04:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574384, 805359, 28742, '<td valign="top">predicted a 6.1? This was so obviously a 6.3. ;-) Great job, Enzo! Got a 7 from me. If anything, I would say the border hurt it <u>very</u> slightly.</td>', 'predicted a 6.1? This was so obviously a 6.3. ;-) Great job, Enzo! Got a 7 from me. If anything, I would say the border hurt it very slightly.', '2009-07-15 04:41:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574385, 805309, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> This has all the makings of a front page finisher. Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Eh, whaddo I know. I still think it''s a 10. :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: This has all the makings of a front page finisher. Congrats!  Eh, whaddo I know. I still think it''s a 10. :-)', '2009-07-15 04:43:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574386, 804582, 102925, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit sad when your photo of looking down at something in a challenge title "Looking Down" comes in behind a picture of a bird cleaning itself.<br/> <br/>I wonder why they bother actually putting subject titles on these challenges at all.</td>', 'It''s a bit sad when your photo of looking down at something in a challenge title "Looking Down" comes in behind a picture of a bird cleaning itself. I wonder why they bother actually putting subject titles on these challenges at all.', '2009-07-15 04:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574387, 803940, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well I scored it a 7. Maybe a little too much dark clutter in the image. Looks like it would be a fun shoot though.</td>', 'Well I scored it a 7. Maybe a little too much dark clutter in the image. Looks like it would be a fun shoot though.', '2009-07-15 04:45:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574389, 805016, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well I really loved it! I thought it has a good stock image quality to it as well as the emotional connection and the excellent title.</td>', 'Well I really loved it! I thought it has a good stock image quality to it as well as the emotional connection and the excellent title.', '2009-07-15 04:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574390, 805217, 63633, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!!! You rock big time Vlado - congratulations!</td>', 'AWESOME!!!! You rock big time Vlado - congratulations!', '2009-07-15 04:51:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574391, 805427, 28742, '<td valign="top">It got an 8 from me.<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Wendy:</b></div><hr/><i>They actually disappear under the boat at times. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Now had you captured the blood, guts &amp; feathers churning up in the wake, I would''ve given it a 10. ;-)</td>', 'It got an 8 from me.Originally posted by Wendy:They actually disappear under the boat at times.  Now had you captured the blood, guts & feathers churning up in the wake, I would''ve given it a 10. ;-)', '2009-07-15 04:51:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574393, 805216, 28742, '<td valign="top">Agree with Tammer - the tattered look of the bird is what appealed to me. I gave it a 7.<br/>Coincidentally, I just saw "A Murder of Crows" (1999 DVD) this past weekend where the title was explained in the movie''s dialog. <br/> <br/>Very nice work, Skip. "shrug" is about all you can do. ...other than scratch your head. :D</td>', 'Agree with Tammer - the tattered look of the bird is what appealed to me. I gave it a 7.Coincidentally, I just saw "A Murder of Crows" (1999 DVD) this past weekend where the title was explained in the movie''s dialog.  Very nice work, Skip. "shrug" is about all you can do. ...other than scratch your head. :D', '2009-07-15 04:55:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574394, 805352, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice job, Ben. I gave it a 6 and should''ve left a comment - the one thing that I think hurt this is the awkward way big sis is holding the baby. If she had cradled it (both arms under), I think it would''ve made a much more positive impact. ...but whaddo I know. Anyway - it''s certainly a family keeper! :D</td>', 'Nice job, Ben. I gave it a 6 and should''ve left a comment - the one thing that I think hurt this is the awkward way big sis is holding the baby. If she had cradled it (both arms under), I think it would''ve made a much more positive impact. ...but whaddo I know. Anyway - it''s certainly a family keeper! :D', '2009-07-15 04:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574395, 805462, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow - how did this end up way down here? I gave it an 8. Must be the orientation that put some folks off.</td>', 'Wow - how did this end up way down here? I gave it an 8. Must be the orientation that put some folks off.', '2009-07-15 05:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574396, 804854, 28742, '<td valign="top">I gave it an 8 and thought it was great.<br/>But now I can see that many disagree.<br/> <br/>Eh, whatcanyado. :)</td>', 'I gave it an 8 and thought it was great.But now I can see that many disagree. Eh, whatcanyado. :)', '2009-07-15 05:02:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574400, 805202, 28742, '<td valign="top">Oooh - I was one of the "middle finger" crowd (gave it a 5). No matter how hard you try to explain it, it just doesn''t scream "from above". Yeah, call me a DNMC Nazi on this one. In any case, you ended up with still an amazing image. ...not that you need any more of those. ...but not that you need any more ribbons either. ...ok, I''m done yammering on. :D</td>', 'Oooh - I was one of the "middle finger" crowd (gave it a 5). No matter how hard you try to explain it, it just doesn''t scream "from above". Yeah, call me a DNMC Nazi on this one. In any case, you ended up with still an amazing image. ...not that you need any more of those. ...but not that you need any more ribbons either. ...ok, I''m done yammering on. :D', '2009-07-15 05:05:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574403, 805062, 88523, '<td valign="top">Way to go Hugo!!!</td>', 'Way to go Hugo!!!', '2009-07-15 05:15:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574404, 804257, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice one! Love the blurred out legs...</td>', 'Nice one! Love the blurred out legs...', '2009-07-15 05:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574420, 805217, 34114, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Vlado! Very well done.</td>', 'Congratulations Vlado! Very well done.', '2009-07-15 05:59:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574434, 805246, 93421, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for their votes and comments - much appreciated.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for their votes and comments - much appreciated.', '2009-07-15 06:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574436, 804582, 62357, '<td valign="top">Challenge was not called "Looking Down", it was "From Above II".  Semantics I know, but let''s at least give it the right title.<br/> <br/>I read your forum post and thought I''d just take a look and comment on the picture.  I think the answer to your question is yes, the subject is important when voting.  And probably that is why you have scored as high as you did, in the same way that the subject is the reason the bird scored as low as it did.  <br/> <br/>In other words, the bird, which placed higher than you, is a very good image, but because it didn''t really meet the challenge as such it has scored lower than it would have done in a Free Study type challenge.<br/> <br/>So, yes, image quality combined with meeting the subject of the challenge contribute to the score.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Challenge was not called "Looking Down", it was "From Above II".  Semantics I know, but let''s at least give it the right title. I read your forum post and thought I''d just take a look and comment on the picture.  I think the answer to your question is yes, the subject is important when voting.  And probably that is why you have scored as high as you did, in the same way that the subject is the reason the bird scored as low as it did.   In other words, the bird, which placed higher than you, is a very good image, but because it didn''t really meet the challenge as such it has scored lower than it would have done in a Free Study type challenge. So, yes, image quality combined with meeting the subject of the challenge contribute to the score. ', '2009-07-15 06:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574443, 805480, 28322, '<td valign="top">This should''ve ribboned</td>', 'This should''ve ribboned', '2009-07-15 06:51:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574476, 805488, 30982, '<td valign="top">Got an 8 from me - he''s adorable!  (And I''m a sucker for amphibians.)</td>', 'Got an 8 from me - he''s adorable!  (And I''m a sucker for amphibians.)', '2009-07-15 07:29:08.000000', NULL, 0),
