(5574566, 804191, 51747, '<td valign="top">Well You and I both lost out on the brown.  I never did get this pic in spite of  the title. I was looking at it as a glass with the widest part being the top of the glass and the narrowest part being the bottom. Duh me :( <br/>I voted this a 6 BTW :)</td>', 'Well You and I both lost out on the brown.  I never did get this pic in spite of  the title. I was looking at it as a glass with the widest part being the top of the glass and the narrowest part being the bottom. Duh me :( I voted this a 6 BTW :)', '2009-07-15 09:10:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574588, 805299, 67152, '<td valign="top">Are there no limits to what you will do to win a ribbon?! Severed heads of poor innocent children....disgusting, absolutely disgusting.   Shannon...you are a very sick man.</td>', 'Are there no limits to what you will do to win a ribbon?! Severed heads of poor innocent children....disgusting, absolutely disgusting.   Shannon...you are a very sick man.', '2009-07-15 09:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
