(5574664, 805360, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well, geez, Scott - you shot a dead bird!!  (Photographically speaking.)  I actually gave you a 7 for poignancy but I''m betting a lot of people wanted this off their screens as fast as possible!  Now if I''d given you a 1, maybe you could have gotten the Brown ;-)</td>', 'Well, geez, Scott - you shot a dead bird!!  (Photographically speaking.)  I actually gave you a 7 for poignancy but I''m betting a lot of people wanted this off their screens as fast as possible!  Now if I''d given you a 1, maybe you could have gotten the Brown ;-)', '2009-07-15 09:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574743, 805360, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sad, but nicely presented if that makes sense.  Dead things rarely score well unless your name is Joey Lawrence.  I think he got away with a dead bird or a dead butterfly or something.</td>', 'Very sad, but nicely presented if that makes sense.  Dead things rarely score well unless your name is Joey Lawrence.  I think he got away with a dead bird or a dead butterfly or something.', '2009-07-15 10:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
