(5575741, 805016, 32011, '<td valign="top">I should have known that this was a Melethia.  Well done.  I love it when a photo draws me in to investigate it in detail... this, like many of your images has those hooks that drag me in and make me take my time to look at it.  Exceptional work...<br/> <br/><i>Edited to fix spelling error.</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-16 01:02:38.</i></td>', 'I should have known that this was a Melethia.  Well done.  I love it when a photo draws me in to investigate it in detail... this, like many of your images has those hooks that drag me in and make me take my time to look at it.  Exceptional work... Edited to fix spelling error.', '2009-07-15 23:12:29.000000', '2009-07-16 02:02:38.000000', 0),
